[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=48 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="值班室的门被水压变了形，只能推开半个人宽。拉姆森先把工具包塞进去，再侧身挤过门缝。她在里面拉了一下灯绳，天花板上的空灯罩晃了好一会儿。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="能进。椅子别坐，下面已经软了。还有谁带了干布？桌面全是盐，手一放上去就像在捏砂纸。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我有一块。不过上面写着擦耳机，我拿来擦桌子以后，会不会有人把我也记到桶上？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="背面能用。别让潮痕看见我们这么随便，她刚刚才相信这里的字是真的有用。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕没有接玩笑。她看着靠窗那张桌子，先摸了摸抽屉的把手。把手外面裹着旧布，布下面压着一小块硬纸，露出一个褪色的笑脸。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="那张桌子以前不在这边。值夜班的人嫌这里反光，看不见外面的灯，总要往墙边搬。后来谁打扫，谁又给她搬回来。"

tone="concern"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="先别照原样摆回去。我们要拍现在的位置，能不能坐着看见灯，也是判断最后那个人怎么值班的线索。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="墙上的值班表停在一半。最后几栏不是空白，而是写过又用水擦掉了。你把手电横过来照，纸面上凹下去的笔画才一点点显出来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这里有两种笔迹。一种把数字写得很挤，另一种每次都留很大的空。最后这段求救，怎么跟前面的字一样？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="声音重播不需要人还坐在这里。纸也可能被照着抄。先找电源，不要因为桌上有一只杯子，就以为杯子的主人刚走。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="杯底粘着一层褐色的东西，杯柄却擦得很干净。德雷顿把它放进袋里，没有喝闻，也没照你预想的那样说出这是什么。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="得回去才能查。闻起来像茶，不代表没有别的东西。现在告诉你“肯定是什么”，只会多一件以后要改口的事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="找到了。重播机接着备用电池，电池是后来换过的。螺丝没生锈，旁边那根线却快断了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森把电池轻轻转向你。底下有两层纸，一层是旧的领用凭条，另一层写着本周的日期。笔尖用力太重，第二层纸背面都能看见印子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="所以有人最近来过。她知道广播一直在放，也换了电池。这和一个旧机器自己不肯停，是两回事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="不一定是她想让广播继续。这里没有单独给航标供电的电池盒，可能拔了重播，灯也会熄。让我先看一下线路。"

tone="concern"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="帕金斯给她让开半步，仍把相机对着接线排。潮痕没有把线拔下来，只沿着颜色一根根指给你看。指到墙外时，她的手停住了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="这根不通灯塔。它下楼以后往西，接到临时码头。有人从那里把声音送进来，不是这间房在呼救。"

tone="concern"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="能分清是实时的，还是另一段重播吗？先别接回去，我们还没确定谁在那一头。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们关掉室内扬声器，只把接收端接到耳机。起初只有细碎的电流声，接着传来两下很轻的敲击。拉姆森敲了桌面三下，对面没有跟着重复。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="别拿敲击试。知道我们在回应的也可能是别的东西。换个只有眼前的人能知道的问题，问外面现在有什么。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="西侧码头上能看见什么颜色的布？这里的风把它吹开了，我看得到一角。你不用报名字，先说颜色。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="耳机里的人说是黄色，你看见的也是黄色。德雷顿却摇头，把窗边那张褪色的宣传纸翻过来。那上面也画着黄色的布，下面印着旧码头的名字。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="这个答案不够。再问一次，问它现在是挂着还是落在地上。照片里那根杆，刚才已经断了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="这次对面迟了几秒，随后说布卡在水面的一截栏杆上，右边还拴着一个蓝桶。你趴低看出去，雨里果然有一小块不随浪走的蓝色。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="登记为需要核查的求援。我们过去，但按接敌准备走，不把所有船都挤到码头边。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="备用电池先带一块。那边的门也是电动的，我不想到了以后才发现，我们只会从外面喊人。"

tone="concern"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把杯子、表和电池凭条分开放好。拉姆森最后一个退出房间，用粉笔在门边写了已经检查的时间，又补上一行：广播来源待查，别在这里等人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="走吧。先看看那只蓝桶。有人的话，把人接上；没人，也把接线看清楚，不能让下一队再在这扇门前耗一次。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_29"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕替你托住快要掉下来的门框。门合回原位以后，屋里又变得像从没来过人。可你知道里面少了一块电池，外面的求援多了一支真正会去看的小队。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_30"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="码头那边的人再次呼叫，问你们能不能带一只罐子。帕金斯以为他说的是燃料罐，让他先报尺寸，对面却说大概两只手能抱住，里面不能灌水。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_31"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="罐子里是什么？我得先知道能不能和别的东西放一起。我们会尽量留位置，但还不能答应全带上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_32"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="码头声音"

speaker_name=""

text="面种。我妻子留下的那一罐。你说不能带，我就分一点装小瓶，剩下的留这儿，可别让人给它拧死了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_33"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森本来正记重量，笔尖停了停。她问为什么不能拧死，对面的人解释了很久，最后自己也说不明白，只反复说它还要喘气。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_34"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="我知道了。不是危险品，也不是没人要的废料。你先装小瓶，最好套两层。要是罐子能带走，我们到那儿再搬。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_35"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="还有别的需要提前告诉我们的吗？腿上有伤，搬不动的东西，锁着的门。都现在说，比我们到了才发现好办。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_36"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="码头声音"

speaker_name=""

text="我能走，邻居腿不好。她不愿意下楼，说上回下去以后，屋里的东西被人拿过。你们别先喊她走，她听见就不理人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_37"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那我们先把船停稳，让她看见上去以后怎么回来。需要帮忙抬什么，也先问她。我们不会一上来就动她的屋子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_38"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="对面低声说了一句好，接着又问，这样绕一圈是不是很耽误你们。德雷顿把话筒接过去，说她们眼下最不缺的，就是已经湿透的人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_39"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="雨再下，也不能多湿一层。你们先把能自己拿的装好，留一只手抓扶手。别把所有东西都抱胸前，到了台阶上才要人接。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_40"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="频道安静下来以后，帕金斯在装备清单上写了“小瓶”。拉姆森看见，特地在后面添上“盖别太紧”。你问她是不是以前见过类似的东西。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_41"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="没有。我只是觉得，他说了三遍，总得有人记住一遍。咱们不懂的东西，未必就不值得占一点地方。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"tideborn": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_42"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="把绳梯再查一遍。不是每个人都能像咱们一样跨过去。等会儿谁负责扶，谁负责看外侧，现在分好，别站到人面前才互相问。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

